BAUXBSD anti-burn-in screensaver - prevents screen burn-in with dynamic
tmux effects when system is idle.

Features:
- Activates after 15 minutes of inactivity
- Dynamic pane effects: splits, swaps, rotations
- Color cycling: btop, cmatrix, fastfetch with random colors
- Status bar manipulation with chaos messages
- Instant recovery on any keypress
- Pure tmux scripting, minimal footprint (~1MB)

WWW: https://roxieos.org